# Sorceress — a Weak enemy of the 1997 game, the deck as the original shipped it.
# tier: 1/12 Weak enemies — 10 life, bribe 40 gold
# enemy: Sorceress (1997 in-game name, s30/assets/text/Advstrings.txt @CREATURENAMES)
# designer: Coyote Tex, MicroProse designer/producer — every enemy deck (precon page, ref. 2)
# variant: Original (base game; the enemy deck files are dated 19 September 1996)
# source: ../shandalar-src/Decks.zip:Decks/0074.dck "Sorceress (R, 4th)" [Tier 3 — Manalink 3
#   file dated 2016-02-15; its first 12 maindeck lines are the 1997 deck, the 14 lines (60
#   cards) after them are the modern deck Manalink appended and are NOT shipped; its
#   .vNone/.v<Colour> sections are the 1997 colour-keyed swaps]
# source: ../s30/assets/configs/rogues/sorceress.toml (main_cards, sideboard_cards, level 1)
#   [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix above]
# source: ../mage-go/rogue_dck/sorceress.dck [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix]
# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Enemy_Decks_(Weak) — "Sorceress" (Original)
#   [Tier-web — maindeck agrees]
# cross-check: a screenshot of the 1997 .DCK file is on the wiki (files.mtg.wiki Shandalar_Sorceress.png)
# group: 1997 originals
name: Sorceress
23 Mountain
3 Iron Star
4 Firebreathing
4 Hurr Jackal
4 Bird Maiden
4 Dwarven Warriors
2 Hurloon Minotaur
2 Dragon Whelp
4 Blood Lust
3 Ball Lightning
2 Meekstone
3 The Brute
2 Shatter
# The 1997 file's colour-keyed sideboard sections. The AI played the maindeck WITHOUT
# .vNone plus the one section matching the player's deck colour (.vNone by default);
# .vNone is folded into the maindeck above, and SB: holds, per name, the largest
# colour-section count minus the .vNone count — the smallest sideboard from which
# every 1997 configuration can be rebuilt by swapping.
#   .vNone   2 Shatter, 1 The Brute
#   .vBlack  2 Shatter, 1 The Brute
#   .vBlue   1 Red Elemental Blast, 2 Shatter
#   .vGreen  1 Shatter, 2 The Brute
#   .vRed    2 Shatter, 1 The Brute
#   .vWhite  1 Sunglasses of Urza, 2 Shatter
SB: 1 The Brute
SB: 1 Red Elemental Blast
SB: 1 Sunglasses of Urza
